{"id":100113,"slug":"100113-mang-object-luu-bang-kieu-mac-dinh-gay-van-de-gi","category":"Elasticsearch","subcategory":"Mapping","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Mảng object lưu bằng kiểu mặc định gây vấn đề gì?","question_en":"What goes wrong when an array of objects uses the default type?","answer_vi":"Kiểu `object` mặc định **làm phẳng mảng**, nên quan hệ giữa các field trong cùng một phần tử bị mất.\n\n```json\n\"variants\": [\n  { \"color\": \"red\",  \"size\": \"S\" },\n  { \"color\": \"blue\", \"size\": \"L\" }\n]\n// index thanh: variants.color = [\"red\",\"blue\"], variants.size = [\"S\",\"L\"]\n```\n\nHậu quả: query tìm `color=red AND size=L` **vẫn khớp** document này dù không có variant nào như vậy. Đây là bug rất khó phát hiện vì kết quả trông hợp lý.\n\nCách sửa là khai báo `nested`:\n\n```json\n\"variants\": { \"type\": \"nested\", \"properties\": { ... } }\n```\n\n```json\n{ \"nested\": { \"path\": \"variants\",\n  \"query\": { \"bool\": { \"filter\": [\n    { \"term\": { \"variants.color\": \"red\" } },\n    { \"term\": { \"variants.size\": \"L\" } }\n  ]}}}}\n```\n\nCái giá của `nested`: **mỗi phần tử được lưu thành một Lucene document ẩn riêng biệt**, nên index phình, update một phần tử phải reindex cả document cha, và query đắt hơn. Chỉ dùng khi thật sự cần giữ quan hệ trong phần tử.","answer_en":"The default `object` type **flattens arrays**, so the relationship between fields inside one element is lost.\n\n```json\n\"variants\": [\n  { \"color\": \"red\",  \"size\": \"S\" },\n  { \"color\": \"blue\", \"size\": \"L\" }\n]\n// indexed as: variants.color = [\"red\",\"blue\"], variants.size = [\"S\",\"L\"]\n```\n\nThe consequence: a query for `color=red AND size=L` **still matches** this document even though no such variant exists. A hard bug to spot because the results look plausible.\n\nThe fix is declaring `nested`:\n\n```json\n\"variants\": { \"type\": \"nested\", \"properties\": { ... } }\n```\n\n```json\n{ \"nested\": { \"path\": \"variants\",\n  \"query\": { \"bool\": { \"filter\": [\n    { \"term\": { \"variants.color\": \"red\" } },\n    { \"term\": { \"variants.size\": \"L\" } }\n  ]}}}}\n```\n\nThe cost of `nested`: **each element becomes its own hidden Lucene document**, so the index grows, updating one element reindexes the whole parent, and queries are more expensive. Use it only when in-element relationships genuinely matter.","answer_html_vi":"<p>Kiểu <code>object</code> mặc định <strong>làm phẳng mảng</strong>, nên quan hệ giữa các field trong cùng một phần tử bị mất.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">json</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&quot;variants&quot;: [\n  { &quot;color&quot;: &quot;red&quot;,  &quot;size&quot;: &quot;S&quot; },\n  { &quot;color&quot;: &quot;blue&quot;, &quot;size&quot;: &quot;L&quot; }\n]\n// index thanh: variants.color = [&quot;red&quot;,&quot;blue&quot;], variants.size = [&quot;S&quot;,&quot;L&quot;]\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;variants&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;color&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;red&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;size&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;S&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;color&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;blue&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;size&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;L&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// index thanh: variants.color = [&quot;red&quot;,&quot;blue&quot;], variants.size = [&quot;S&quot;,&quot;L&quot;]</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Hậu quả: query tìm <code>color=red AND size=L</code> <strong>vẫn khớp</strong> document này dù không có variant nào như vậy. Đây là bug rất khó phát hiện vì kết quả trông hợp lý.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Cách sửa là khai báo <code>nested</code>:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">json</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&quot;variants&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;nested&quot;, &quot;properties&quot;: { ... } }\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;variants&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;type&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;nested&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;properties&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> ... <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">json</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"{ &quot;nested&quot;: { &quot;path&quot;: &quot;variants&quot;,\n  &quot;query&quot;: { &quot;bool&quot;: { &quot;filter&quot;: [\n    { &quot;term&quot;: { &quot;variants.color&quot;: &quot;red&quot; } },\n    { &quot;term&quot;: { &quot;variants.size&quot;: &quot;L&quot; } }\n  ]}}}}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;nested&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;path&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;variants&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;query&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;bool&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;filter&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;term&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;variants.color&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;red&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;term&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;variants.size&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;L&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Cái giá của <code>nested</code>: <strong>mỗi phần tử được lưu thành một Lucene document ẩn riêng biệt</strong>, nên index phình, update một phần tử phải reindex cả document cha, và query đắt hơn.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Chỉ dùng khi thật sự cần giữ quan hệ trong phần tử.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p>The default <code>object</code> type <strong>flattens arrays</strong>, so the relationship between fields inside one element is lost.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">json</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&quot;variants&quot;: [\n  { &quot;color&quot;: &quot;red&quot;,  &quot;size&quot;: &quot;S&quot; },\n  { &quot;color&quot;: &quot;blue&quot;, &quot;size&quot;: &quot;L&quot; }\n]\n// indexed as: variants.color = [&quot;red&quot;,&quot;blue&quot;], variants.size = [&quot;S&quot;,&quot;L&quot;]\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;variants&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;color&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;red&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;size&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;S&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;color&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;blue&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;size&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;L&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// indexed as: variants.color = [&quot;red&quot;,&quot;blue&quot;], variants.size = [&quot;S&quot;,&quot;L&quot;]</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">The consequence: a query for <code>color=red AND size=L</code> <strong>still matches</strong> this document even though no such variant exists. A hard bug to spot because the results look plausible.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">The fix is declaring <code>nested</code>:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">json</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&quot;variants&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;nested&quot;, &quot;properties&quot;: { ... } }\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-