ass=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;nested&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;path&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;variants&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;query&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;bool&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;filter&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;term&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;variants.color&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;red&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;term&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;variants.size&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;L&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">The cost of <code>nested</code>: <strong>each element becomes its own hidden Lucene document</strong>, so the index grows, updating one element reindexes the whole parent, and queries are more expensive.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Use it only when in-element relationships genuinely matter.</p>","references":[{"label":"Elastic — Nested field type","url":"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/nested.html"},{"label":"Elastic — Explicit mapping","url":"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/explicit-mapping.html"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/100103-text-va-keyword-khac-nhau-ra-sao-khi-nao-dung-cai-nao","title":"`text` và `keyword` khác nhau ra sao? Khi nào dùng cái nào?"},{"url":"/q/100108-dynamic-mapping-la-gi-va-vi-sao-nguy-hiem-o-production","title":"Dynamic mapping là gì và vì sao nguy hiểm ở production?"},{"url":"/q/100122-vi-sao-sort-tren-field-text-bi-tu-choi","title":"Vì sao sort trên field `text` bị từ chối?"},{"url":"/q/100101-inverted-index-la-gi-va-vi-sao-no-lam-full-text-search-nhanh","title":"Inverted index là gì và vì sao nó làm full-text search nhanh?"},{"url":"/q/100102-shard-va-replica-khac-nhau-the-nao-chon-so-shard-bao-nhieu","title":"Shard và replica khác nhau thế nào? Chọn số shard bao nhiêu?"},{"url":"/q/100104-analyzer-gom-nhung-thanh-phan-nao-va-vi-sao-phai-hieu-no","title":"Analyzer gồm những thành phần nào và vì sao phải hiểu nó?"},{"url":"/q/100105-match-va-term-khac-nhau-the-nao-vi-sao-term-hay-tra-ve-rong","title":"`match` và `term` khác nhau thế nào? Vì sao `term` hay trả về rỗng?"},{"url":"/q/100106-index-xong-mot-document-nhung-search-ngay-khong-thay-vi-sao","title":"Index xong một document nhưng search ngay không thấy. Vì sao?"}]}